WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.610
Hi, I'm Lily from Paddle Match.

2
00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.730
We make carbon fiber pickleball paddles under your brand.

3
00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.570
Meet our T700 carbon paddle.

4
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:16.920
The face is T700 carbon fiber, in 3K or 12K weave,

5
00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:20.350
hot-pressed as a one-piece unibody for a solid, consistent feel.

6
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:25.880
Inside is a PP honeycomb core, 16 or 14 millimeters thick,

7
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:30.430
