8
00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:34.030
Everything can carry your brand:

9
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:38.370
logo, graphics, colors, grip and packaging.

10
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.170
Orders start at 300 pieces.

11
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.370
Samples take about 12 days, up to 10 pieces,

12
00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:48.270
and bulk production takes 35 to 40 days.

13
00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:54.140
Send us your design and target specs,

14
00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:56.140
